        "text": "The petitioners ask when a district attorney's office may be liable under \u00a71983 for inadequate training of prosecutors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ae201a22e7c0c0759674a09ab7d801ac94829347bc3f4eb4769a4db5410beaa",
