            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioners contend the office was liable because it was deliberately indifferent to Brady training, even though there was no pattern of prior misconduct."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ae201a22e7c0c0759674a09ab7d801ac94829347bc3f4eb4769a4db5410beaa",
