            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court exempted the case from the ordinary pattern requirement by analogizing to a hypothetical in the Court\u2019s City of Canton opinion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ae201a22e7c0c0759674a09ab7d801ac94829347bc3f4eb4769a4db5410beaa",
